OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADrought conditions could continue,
OL,4,Acompany warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth East Water (SEW) is warning
OL,7,Fdrought conditions across Sussex could
OL,8,F"easily" continue into 2027 if the
OL,9,Fcurrent lack of rain persists.
OL,11,FIn a letter to its customers on
OL,12,FThursday, the company said so far in
OL,13,FNovember Sussex had seen just 62.5% of
OL,14,Fits average rainfall.
OL,16,FThis, combined with 2026's
OL,17,F"exceptionally dry spring and summer",
OL,18,Fmeant the county's reservoirs had still
OL,19,Fnot reached the levels necessary for
OL,20,Fdrought conditions to be lifted, SEW
OL,21,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
