OL,3,GNEWSADrought conditions could continue,
OL,4,Acompany warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency estimates Sussex
OL,7,Fneeds 120% of its average rainfall over
OL,8,Fthe next "five or six months" for
OL,9,Fsupplies to fully recover by spring,
OL,10,Fthe letter says.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
